<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of December 30, the only trading day of the week, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	    51.28 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	   37.98 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			  13.31 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net selling     18.21 billion yen</p>
